                <pb facs="0189" n="93" sameAs="frus:frus1900/pg93"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Inclosure 3.]</seg></opener>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">A decree issued by the Empress Dowager and published
                        in the Manuscript Pekin Gazette on the 28th of January, 1900.</hi></head>
                <p>Next year (July 22, 1900) the Emperor will have reached the thirtieth anniversary
                    of his birthday, and it is right and befitting that the occasion should be
                    celebrated by the observance of proper ceremonial.</p>
                <p>Let all the proper yamens examine the precedents and fixed usages as to the
                    ceremonial that should be observed on such occasions and memorialize us on the
                    subject.</p>
            </div>
